  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4b39fe89b7a77f5542ca614036094b250800fffb707b81958f433eb2c96acebe.png] \n\nGiven equation: 20 + 2 ÷ 4 - 8 × 28 = 30\n\nOption 1) × and -\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ 20 + __**2 ÷ 4 × 8**__ - 28 = 30\n\n⇒ __**20 + **4__ - 28 = 30\n\n⇒ __**24 - 28**__ = 30\n\n⇒ -4 = 30\n\n**Option 2) × and +**\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**20 × 2 ÷ 4**__ - 8 + 28 = 30\n\n⇒ **__10__** - 8 __**+ 28**__ = 30\n\n⇒ __**38 - 8**__ = 30\n\n**⇒ 30 = 30**\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ 20 + 2 × 4 - __**8 ÷ 28**__ = 30\n\n⇒ 20 + __**2 × 4**__ - 0.28 = 30\n\n⇒ __**20 + 8 - 0.28**__ = 30\n\n⇒ 27.72 = 30\n\nOption 4) + and ​÷\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 2**__ + 4 - 8 × 28 = 30\n\n⇒ 10 + 4 - __**8 × 28**__ = 30\n\n⇒ __**10 + 4 - 224**__ = 30\n\n⇒ 210 = 30\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"× and +\".**",
